{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "spanish", "appid": 548430, "month": "2025-11", "window": 2, "start_date": 1762646400, "end_date": 1763251199, "month_true_total": 134, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:13:27 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "209317524", "author": {"steamid": "76561199476688966", "personaname": "Arturo-Pratt", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199476688966/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 6254, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 10, "playtime_at_review": 6243, "last_played": 1787166316, "avatar": "37cf1dc1f48ac849fb89a0b11182816609a9e6eb"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "MUCHA CERVEZA Y MUCHA ROCA \nY MATAR BICHOSSS\ncon enanos barbudos\nGOTY", "timestamp_created": 1763235455, "timestamp_updated": 1764091985, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209230755", "author": {"steamid": "76561199871072480", "personaname": "Mister_Basado", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199871072480/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 13165, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4516, "last_played": 1774219223, "avatar": "4035d0fe88afe98f62ae3bac7f370e6f76d8f6c3"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "JUEGARDOOO, he jugado mas de 200 horas en la play 4 a esta bella cosa. Y decidi comprarlo en steam cuando cambie a pc para ver como era. Y es... otra cosa completamente distinta. Mods que no hacen falta descargar para añadirlos, que dan una frescura bastante llamativa al juego, una de las mejores comunidades que posee los videojuegos por su lenguaje universal, ampliedad de misiones, excavaciones profundas, personajes y distintas armas que poder conseguir en estos enanos es simplemente increible. Solo hay 2 cosas que añadir: Es MUY RECOMENDABLE jugar con amigos, la experiencia es completamente distinta y no tenes que esperar a otras sesiones. Y la segunda es, que me gustaria que añadieran crossplay, eso aumentaria de una manera significativa la comunidad, aunque, creo que eso esta por cambiar con la llegada de STEAM a XBOX. Uno de los mejores juegos para jugar con amigos, ser un enano bien barbudo y matar bichos a lo loco. ¡ROCK AND STONE!", "timestamp_created": 1763161035, "timestamp_updated": 1763161035, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209223848", "author": {"steamid": "76561199090505797", "personaname": "Luca.ma8", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199090505797/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 12604, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8094, "last_played": 1774101598, "avatar": "c4620ee56f16c1a32629d6b66df19f60a37b7bfc"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "juegazo lisa y llanamente, tanto en apartado grafico como en jugabilidad.\r\nmezcla 4 monos encocados, cerveza, armas, y muchisimos bichos con claras intenciones hacerte picada uno mas grande que el otro.\r\ntiene variedad de misiones y enemigos, ademas de 4 clases de enanos cada uno con una forma pelear distintiva.\r\nen criollo, esta mas bueno que asado del domigo, mas si tenes amigos que acompañen", "timestamp_created": 1763154417, "timestamp_updated": 1763154417, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209146103", "author": {"steamid": "76561199217811565", "personaname": "ramonelnormal", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199217811565/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 13284, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3887, "last_played": 1782167906, "avatar": "ab9b6fada5ef6c8555446c0fa36d36cad7d51008"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "recomendadisimo,con o sin amigos es un gran juego", "timestamp_created": 1763066065, "timestamp_updated": 1763066065, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209136757", "author": {"steamid": "76561198164955514", "personaname": "wolfsnake97", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wolfsnake97/", "num_games_owned": 438, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 2322, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1568, "last_played": 1764268224, "avatar": "1a15d5ef5d0eb66b57377936741cff92db2eee61"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "YOU ARE GOOD MULE MOLLY", "timestamp_created": 1763057865, "timestamp_updated": 1763057865, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}